`),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3074.45},"To visually illustrate this quiet but rapid change, this infographic "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3095.45},"uses the p5.js library to translate the shift in ocean chemistry into a "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3116.45},"two‑colour Risograph-inspired print"),x.createElement("tspan",{x:1093.13,y:3137.45},". A "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3158.45},"yellow shell for 1985 and a fluorescent pink shell for each "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3179.45},"subsequent year are rendered on separate virtual Riso layers using "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3200.45},"the p5.Riso library  created by "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:942.807,y:3200.45}," and "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:1068.16,y:3200.45},".\u2028"),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3221.45},`
`),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3242.45},"The registration between these layers is entirely data‑driven. As "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3263.45},"measured pH declines through time, the pink shell is progressively "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3284.45},"displaced along the x‑axis, while its outline acquires additional "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3305.45},"wobble and a subtle warp. Misregistration becomes a visual proxy "),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3326.45},"for increasing acidity rather than a printing error.\u2028"),x.createElement("tspan",{x:592.035,y:3347.45},`
